; Words to be spelled, made ready. Cards pass through except words: a word's letters (1-27) go onto this machine's
; own pile (OUT at keep, back to INP at gp), counting n (cards) and l (letters). A word ended by -10 goes on as it
; came, then -10. One ended by -11 goes on as its letters, apostrophes dropped, as 100 + code, the last as 200 +
; code, then -11, for names.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            rec     INP   x        03-16: a card: pass it on, a letter, or a word's end
  04                    CLA   x
  05                    TAC   neg
  06                    SUB   c28
  07                    TAC   let
  08            pass    OUT   x
  09                    JMP   rec
  10            neg     ADD   c11
  11                    TAC   pass
  12                    SUB   00
  13                    TAC   e11
  14                    SUB   00
  15                    TAC   e10
  16                    JMP   pass
  17            let     ADD   c28      17-29: onto the pile, counted
  18            keep    OUT   x
  19                    CLA   n
  20                    ADD   00
  21                    STO   n
  22                    CLA   x
  23                    SUB   c27
  24                    TAC   lt
  25                    JMP   rec
  26            lt      CLA   l
  27                    ADD   00
  28                    STO   l
  29                    JMP   rec
  30            e10     CLA   n        30-38: not spelled: the word as it came
  31                    SUB   00
  32                    TAC   o10
  33                    STO   n
  34            gp      INP   y
  35                    OUT   y
  36                    JMP   e10
  37            o10     OUT   m10
  38                    JMP   rst
  39            e11     CLA   n        39-65: spelled: the letters marked, the last 200
  40                    SUB   00
  41                    TAC   o11
  42                    STO   n
  43            gp2     INP   y
  44                    CLA   y
  45                    SUB   c27
  46                    TAC   lm
  47                    JMP   e11
  48            lm      CLA   l
  49                    SUB   00
  50                    STO   l
  51                    SUB   00
  52                    TAC   last
  53                    CLA   y
  54                    ADD   c100
  55                    JMP   oy
  56            last    CLA   y
  57                    ADD   c200
  58            oy      STO   y
  59                    OUT   y
  60                    JMP   e11
  61            o11     OUT   m11
  62            rst     CLA   z
  63                    STO   n
  64                    STO   l
  65                    JMP   rec
  70            x       DATA  0
  71            y       DATA  0
  72            n       DATA  0
  73            l       DATA  0
  74            z       DATA  0
  75            c11     DATA  11
  76            c27     DATA  27
  77            c28     DATA  28
  78            c100    DATA  100
  79            c200    DATA  200
  80            m10     DATA  -10
  81            m11     DATA  -11
